{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1257\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Arial;}}\f0\fs24 M\u363?sdien\u257?s daudzi skol\u275?ni izmanto ChatGPT un l\u299?dz\u299?gus r\u299?kus. Es uzskatu, ka m\u257?ksl\u299?gais intelekts skol\u257? vair\u257?k trauc\u275? nek\u257? pal\u299?dz.\par
\par
Pirmk\u257?rt, skol\u275?ni var \u316?aut MI uzrakst\u299?t darbus vi\u326?u viet\u257?, un tad vi\u326?i pa\u353?i neko neiem\u257?c\u257?s, jo nemaz nedom\u257? patst\u257?v\u299?gi. Otrk\u257?rt, MI da\u382?reiz k\u316?\u363?d\u257?s vai izdom\u257? faktus, un skol\u275?ns, kur\u353? to nep\u257?rbauda, iem\u257?c\u257?s nepareizi. Piem\u275?ram, k\u257?ds puisis no paral\u275?l\u257?s klases iesniedza MI uzrakst\u299?tu refer\u257?tu, bet, kad skolot\u257?ja pal\u363?dza to izst\u257?st\u299?t, vi\u326?\u353? nesp\u275?ja paskaidrot nevienu teikumu.\par
\par
T\u257?p\u275?c, manupr\u257?t, skol\u257? MI b\u363?tu j\u257?izmanto \u316?oti uzman\u299?gi, jo cit\u257?di tas vair\u257?k kait\u275? nek\u257? pal\u299?dz.}